    "contract":  "Squealer Thornmantle 3229 lives in nested pool 484 (max_limit 1) whose children 485-488 each hold one Squealer and one Bristleback Shaman 2953 with 76 s timers. Killing both members of the active child queues two respawn timers; the first re-rolls the mother pool and may despawn that child, so the second timer is stale. Expected: the stale timer is dropped and exactly one Squealer is up after every cycle. Before the fix the stale timer re-rolled the mother pool again and left two Squealers in about 3 of 4 cycles, so three cycles leave a residual pass chance of about 1/64 for the broken tree; the fixed tree always passes.",
